<title>UK: UK M4 grows final 10.8 pct in year to Nov.</title>
<headline>UK M4 grows final 10.8 pct in year to Nov.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following data on UK monetary aggregates for November -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY				     Nov    pvs reported</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (adjusted)		1.1	  1.1</p>
<p>	 in year to date (adjusted)	     10.8	 10.8</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (unadjusted)	    1.6	  1.6</p>
<p>	 in year to date (unadjusted)	   10.7	 10.8</p>
<p>Adjusted lending by banks, building</p>
<p>    societies in billions of stg		 7.0	 7.0</p>
</text>
